".`,`Bus Entry {objectID} isn't connect with Bus. It\u2018s "Name" doesn't macth the Bus naming rule.`,`Bus Entry {objectID} isn't connect with Bus. It's "Name" doesn't within the Bus index. Please modify it's "Name" or use "Short Symbol" to connect with Bus.`,"Bus Entry {objectID} of Bus {objectID2} doesn\u2018t within the Bus or Wire."]},NUMBERTOPIN:{level:0,enforce:!0,value:"The same Pin Number of parts must connect to a same network",linkLog:["Component {ComponentID}\xA0\xA0pins with the same number are connected to different networks, {PinID1} ."]},PORTNEEDTITLE:{level:1,enforce:!0,value:"The Netflag, Netport needs\xA0a name",linkLog:["Netflag {objectID}\xA0has no name.","Netport {objectID} has no name."]},IRRSYMBOLNETNAME:{level:1,enforce:!0,value:'The wire name must same as "Global Net Name" value if netflag or netport has "Global Net Name" property',linkLog:[`Wire {objectID} connects with the Net Flag which property "Global Net Name" is\xA0{objectID2}, wire's "Name" needs to be same as the Net Flag "Global Net Name" value, please modify.`]},OVERLAPPIN:{level:0,enforce:!0,value:"The endpoint of pins cannot overlap and are not connected",linkLog:["The endpoints of pins {objectID} overlap and are not connected."]},SHOWFLOATING:{level:2,enforce:!0,value:"The wire must not be a free wire (no components Pin attached)",linkLog:["The wire {objectID} is a free network with no pins attached."]},SHOWDANDLING:{level:2,enforce:!0,value:"The wire must not be a single net wire (Only one component Pin attached)",linkLog:["The wire {objectID} is a single network connected to only one component pin."]},PORTNONET:{level:3,enforce:!0,value:"The Netlable,Netflag,Netport,Shortsymbol, Differential Pairs Flag needs to be connected to the Wire or Bus",linkLog:["Netlabel {objectID}\xA0is not connected to wire or bus.","NetFlag {objectID} is not connected to wire or bus.","Shortsymbol {objectID} is not connected to wire or bus.","Netport {objectID}\xA0is not connected to wire or bus."